  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subsidy for Responsible Business SMEs (SVOM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Subsidy for Responsible Business for SMEs (SVOM) helps you apply due diligence to identify, prevent, and mitigate risks to people and the environment within your supply chain.You can use the subsidy, for example, to develop an International Responsible Business policy to develop a risk assessment with the stakeholders. You can also use the subsidy to prepare your supply chain partner for (indirect) legal requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
